{
	quest.0A93C88CF7C9C0FD.quest_desc: [
		"How are you going to spend money if you can't make money? "
		""
		"This section is to teach you about different ways you can make some moolah on Horizon (on multiplayer servers)."
	]
	quest.1131EC987F15EAF8.quest_desc: [
		"&6Spurs&r and &6Cogs&r are high tier forms of currency. A cog is worth 64 spurs."
		""
		"They can be upgraded only through a &eBank Terminal&r. Spurs can be used in the &eDaily Shop&r to buy things or in &eVendors&r to sell to and buy from players in multiplayer."
	]
	quest.1131EC987F15EAF8.title: "Spurs \\& Cogs"
	quest.17C90B1D2FCC0AAB.quest_desc: [
		"Vendors are efficient ways you can &abuy or sell&r items. "
		""
		"By sneak right clicking the Vendor, you can access its menu, where you can select the cost, the amount you want to buy/sell and what item to buy/sell."
		""
		"Vendors can be refilled &dautomatically&r with blocks such as hoppers and funnels. After a customer buys an item, the currency is stored within the Vendor, unless it has a &eCard&r."
	]
	quest.18C37C06B8EB1F19.quest_desc: ["To get a little motivation to earn money, here's a chicken taco!"]
	quest.1BAFFF38362F0124.quest_desc: [
		"Viridium Numismatic Extractors are a seperate upgrade path."
		""
		"Although, it is slower than the regular Numismatic Extractor, taking twice as much, Viridium Numismatic Extractor make up for it by being able to have items inserted!"
		""
		"<turb a=0.2>What's a bit of extra waiting time, when you can just constantly feed it and have it running in the background?</turb>"
	]
	quest.1EDB3A4B8C3922EB.quest_desc: ["You gotta learn to make money to spend money! Get a stack of diamonds and deposit it into an &aExtractor&r!"]
	quest.22AC4F0F8F015EFE.quest_desc: ["You are now rich! Be sure to gamble it all at &aRiamo's Casino&r to become richer!"]
	quest.24D11A094A7B9277.quest_desc: ["Obtain 69 cogs."]
	quest.2732331BA64DF7D4.quest_desc: [
		"Surrounding an Numismatic Extractor with Cobalt will upgrade it, making the process faster!"
		"Each process now takes 5 seconds less."
	]
	quest.273580A9FBFC27C3.quest_desc: ["The &6Piggy Bank&r allows you to store your coins in a convenient place. It also automatically converts your coins to the highest tier of coin when possible."]
	quest.295DF9165FE26B7D.quest_desc: [
		"Welcome to the economy of Horizon! Horizon uses Mayview coins and Create: Numismatics as its form of currency."
		""
		"Numismatics is a &2currency mod&r that boasts easy-to-use systems for simple shops as well as leaving room for your wildest redstone money-making dreams."
		""
		"Numismatics, paired with Horizon's custom &bExractors&r, will be the key to becoming the capitalist of all capitalists."
	]
	quest.29F26D32B09DAE28.quest_desc: [
		"&6Coins&r are a low tier form of currency. They replace Emeralds inside of Villager trades and are mainly used to trade with Villagers. Coins can also be found as loot inside of chests."
		""
		"They come in &#FF7E0FCopper&r, &7Iron&r, &eGold&r and &bDiamond&r variants and can be upgraded (or downgraded) to each tier at a rate of 1:8."
		""
		"1 &bDiamond&r = 8 &eGold&r = 64 &7Iron&r = 512 &#FF7E0FCopper&r"
	]
	quest.29F26D32B09DAE28.title: "Coins"
	quest.3351ABA1907E8F11.quest_desc: ["The &6Bank Meter&r is an item you can put in your accessories slot, that will then display your current bank balance on the left corner of yours screen."]
	quest.34397A99252E120E.quest_desc: [
		"&cDepositors&r allow you to set a price, and then emit 1 redstone tick pulse once a player deposits money."
		""
		"Players can deposit money using their Bank Card or Coins in their inventory."
		""
		"Brass Depositors allow you to select varied prices whereas Andesite Depositors are a single type."
	]
	quest.3591787072D3A56B.quest_desc: [
		"What's the point of making money if you aren't going to spend it?"
		""
		"This section is to teach you about spending money and different ways to hold currency."
	]
	quest.373BD8573DAB6F05.quest_desc: [
		"&bID Cards&r are used to allow other players access to Numismatics' protected blocks. (Vendors, Depositors, Blaze Bankers)."
		""
		"These ID Cards allow you to easily &agive access&r to other players or for others to give you access."
	]
	quest.373BD8573DAB6F05.title: "Business Partner"
	quest.3B0E634B072FFAB9.quest_desc: [
		"Aside from Spurs and Cogs, there are 6 total forms of currency in Horizon. Like coins, they also convert at a rate of 1:8."
		""
		"1. &#f29062&lSpur&r"
		"2. &#d3fcd9Bevel&r"
		"3. &#a6a6a6Sprocket&r"
		"4. &#f8ca67&lCog&r"
		"5. &#faf25eCrown&r"
		"6. &#4c4042Sun&r"
		""
		"1 &#4c4042Sun&r = 8 &#faf25eCrown&r = 16 &#f8ca67Cog&r = 64 &#a6a6a6Sprocket&r = 512 &#d3fcd9Bevel&r = 4096 &#f29062Spur&r"
	]
	quest.3B0E634B072FFAB9.title: "All Currencies"
	quest.440BF4BD7E53ADCA.quest_desc: [
		"The &6Selling Bin&r is a simple block that is able to sell certain items into coins."
		""
		"It can be configured inside of its menu, allowing you to specify which coin to extract, if it makes sound when an item is sold or enable auto-selling."
	]
	quest.440BF4BD7E53ADCA.quest_subtitle: "A different selling bin"
	quest.4655B1359AD0AEA7.quest_desc: ["&6Portable Bank Terminals&r, as the name implies, are an item version of &eBank Terminals&r, basically allowing you to access your bank without a block placed nearby."]
	quest.46DCF3A45AC8AE12.quest_desc: [
		"Numismatic Extractors are <rainb><turb a=1>the new thing</turb></rainb>!"
		""
		"The Numismatic Extractor takes one input at a time and converts them into either &eCoins&r or &eSpurs&r. Automatable things, such as crops, will be turned into Coins, while items that require more manual labor will turn into Spurs."
		""
		"However, they are relatively slow. It's better to make a few of them and leave them running in the background while working on something else."
		""
		"While items cannot be inserted into them automatically, the outputs can be extracted."
		""
		"The Extractors also accept redstone input to pause their process, if you ever need to pause it for whatever reason."
		""
		"You can get a list of items that can be sold by typing &#54FC54#sellables&r into the EMI search bar."
	]
	quest.46DCF3A45AC8AE12.quest_subtitle: "Selling Bins are <wave a=0.5 w=-1>SOOOOOO 2023...</wave>"
	quest.4A6B75EE39D44279.quest_desc: ["You're welcome, Optimum."]
	quest.4A6B75EE39D44279.title: "&zFacebook Marketplace&r"
	quest.50771B7DE492484B.quest_desc: [
		"One account is never enough! Banking Guides are used to create &cBlaze Bankers&r for your shop. "
		""
		"Blaze Bankers function as \"business accounts\". With ID cards, you can select which players can access your separate business bank."
		""
		"To create a Blaze Banker, &9right click&r on a Blaze Burner with a Banking Guide."
	]
	quest.50771B7DE492484B.quest_subtitle: "Tax Evasion..?"
	quest.52A0BC157996FAEB.quest_desc: [
		"The &6Daily Shop&r contains various assortment of items that &bchange every 20 minutes&r. These items can range from seeds and saplings to food and Cobblemon items."
		""
		"The items sold are global, meaning each player will see the same list."
		""
		"You can get a list of items that you can buy by typing &#54FC54#buyables&r in the EMI search bar."
	]
	quest.543F46FD8417388E.quest_desc: [
		"&6Congratulations&r! You've learned the basics of the economy! "
		""
		"Please Continue to learn more about the mod and &aget rich&r!"
	]
	quest.543F46FD8417388E.title: "Investment Banker"
	quest.578A7AFE0AD8097F.quest_desc: ["Obtain 9 stacks of Suns. Lock in."]
	quest.5805248A3C7194DD.quest_desc: ["You did it! (I think)"]
	quest.5805248A3C7194DD.title: "Adventure Capitalist"
	quest.600C3DF9E022CD07.quest_desc: ["Coin Pouches simply give 2 to 7 &#FF7E0FCopper Coins&r when right clicked."]
	quest.635277AB45341F75.quest_desc: [
		"&6Bank Terminals&r are blocks, where you can store all of your Spurs \\& Cogs. &6Terminals&r &aautomatically convert&r your currency, making it easy for players to exchange them."
		""
		"The &6terminals&r allow you to access your own bank account, or an account you are trusted with."
	]
	quest.635277AB45341F75.title: "Bank of Horizon"
	quest.6E20F9A0F543F66B.quest_desc: ["Obtain 420 Spurs."]
	quest.7D23311381B93D29.quest_desc: ["Upgrading the Cobalt version to Adamantite will cause the process to be even faster. Now it only takes 5 seconds for each item to be processed instead!"]
	quest.7E76A01A545F401A.quest_desc: [
		"&6Bank Cards&r can be used in place of Cogs \\& Spurs. Using them on a Vendor or Depositor &6extracts funds&r from the Bank Account the Card is linked to, instead of taking currency from your inventory."
		""
		"Bank Cards can also be placed in a Depositor or Vendor to have funds go directly into the associated account."
	]
	quest.7E76A01A545F401A.quest_subtitle: "<wave a=0.5 w=-1>Coins No More!</wave>"
	quest.7E76A01A545F401A.title: "Credit Karma"
	task.134CB02E4D15BCB2.title: "Any ID Card"
	task.25B51A33D8E2819F.title: "Demand"
	task.3B4D9AED59BF2485.title: "Now we Here"
	task.4665E02D2D1AB575.title: "Supply"
	task.5A3A1F63E2453311.title: "Welcome to Numismatics!"
	task.65024F66760B6A2D.title: "Any Card"
	task.76A157F5BFA5616D.title: "Cookie Clicker"
}
